WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:05.230
We need the legendary hero's blood
to ensure the future of the royal line.

00:05.660 --> 00:11.380
But we've already promised the first 
and second princesses to nearby kingdoms.

00:11.380 --> 00:13.450
What about Marguerite, then?

00:15.410 --> 00:17.520
It's just a scratch.

00:17.520 --> 00:19.120
Really, Your Highness...

00:19.120 --> 00:21.450
You're such a crybaby.

00:23.170 --> 00:24.460
Have you lost your mind, sire?!

00:25.010 --> 00:27.540
Have you forgotten 
the late queen's dying words?

00:27.540 --> 00:28.420
Princess Marguerite mustn't—

00:28.420 --> 00:30.880
Raise her to be a strong girl.

00:30.880 --> 00:35.280
A strong mother worthy of raising
the legendary hero's children.

00:37.390 --> 00:39.440
<b><i>HE'S DEAD</i></b>

00:49.200 --> 00:50.090
<b>THE</b>

00:50.090 --> 00:50.630
<b>LEGEN</b>

00:50.630 --> 00:51.130
<b>DARY</b>

00:51.130 --> 00:51.590
<b>HERO</b>

00:51.590 --> 00:52.090
<b>IS</b>

00:52.050 --> 00:52.550
<b>DEAD</b>

02:06.480 --> 02:10.150
<b>Episode 4</b>

02:06.480 --> 02:10.150
<b>The Legendary Hero and Bride</b>

02:07.710 --> 02:08.440
Let's see!

02:08.440 --> 02:10.170
Will she pierce the apple,

02:10.170 --> 02:13.360
earning them a year's supply of apples?!

02:13.890 --> 02:16.330
Or will she kill him?!

02:16.330 --> 02:18.780
<i>Hey, it's cool. I'm already a zombie.</i>

02:18.780 --> 02:21.370
<i>As long as it's not
a mana-infused attack, I'll survive.</i>

02:21.370 --> 02:24.830
As a reminder, there's a defensive 
spell cast on that apple!

02:24.830 --> 02:26.700
She's gotta infuse her shot with mana!

02:26.700 --> 02:27.960
<i>Oh, I'm dead.</i>

02:29.420 --> 02:30.820
Magnificent!

02:30.820 --> 02:34.000
Our challengers win a year's worth of apples!

02:34.310 --> 02:37.590
I'm sorry. I just got so hungry...

02:37.590 --> 02:41.910
H-Hey, better this than having you pass out.

02:41.910 --> 02:44.080
But couldn't we have tried
an eating contest instead?

02:44.080 --> 02:45.660
I-I'm sorry...

02:45.660 --> 02:46.990
No, I'm impressed.

02:46.990 --> 02:49.740
You don't just do art,
you also know archery.

02:49.740 --> 02:51.980
Those are part of a princess's education.

02:51.980 --> 02:54.760
Ever since my youth, 
I've received daily lessons

02:54.760 --> 02:58.340
in etiquette, academics, 
martial arts, and the fine arts.

02:58.340 --> 03:01.260
For real? Being a royal sounds rough.

03:01.780 --> 03:03.990
I did it all so that we could be together...

03:04.390 --> 03:05.480
What was that?

03:05.480 --> 03:08.450
N-Nothing! Let's enjoy the day!

03:08.450 --> 03:09.410
Is that an earthquake?

03:09.990 --> 03:12.880
That damnable Isaac,
appointing me to observe their date...

03:13.770 --> 03:14.840
Still...

03:15.170 --> 03:19.300
Sion looks frighteningly
like a talking skeleton to me.

03:20.930 --> 03:23.000
<i>If we could not ever be together,</i>

03:23.000 --> 03:25.000
<i>we should meet nevermore.</i>

03:27.100 --> 03:31.190
<i>You respected my wishes and took your leave.</i>

03:31.910 --> 03:36.400
<i>But I continued my intense 
training to be worthy of you.</i>

03:36.890 --> 03:40.080
<i>Not a day went by that I didn't think of you.</i>

03:40.830 --> 03:44.880
<i>So when you returned to me 
and agreed to marry me,</i>

03:44.880 --> 03:46.490
<i>I felt truly happy.</i>

03:46.900 --> 03:49.750
<i>I could finally fulfill my
duty as a princess.</i>

03:50.360 --> 03:53.200
<i>But now I'm even happier.</i>

03:53.200 --> 03:58.770
<i>For now I feel for you... 
not just as a princess, but as a woman.</i>

03:59.330 --> 04:01.470
Wow, pulling me away from prying eyes...

04:01.470 --> 04:03.360
You're bold, aren't you?

04:03.360 --> 04:05.140
Th-That wasn't my intent.

04:05.140 --> 04:07.260
I want to watch the fireworks with you here!

04:07.880 --> 04:12.230
Although, if you wished it... I would...

04:14.190 --> 04:16.140
<i>That expression!</i>

04:16.140 --> 04:17.500
<i>She'd let me do it!</i>

04:17.500 --> 04:20.360
<i>She'd let me put stockings on those thighs!</i>

04:21.580 --> 04:23.160
Whoa, that scared me!

04:23.160 --> 04:25.070
It's the finale of the celebration.

04:25.070 --> 04:28.900
Beneath the beautiful fireworks, 
people search out their soulmate,

04:28.900 --> 04:33.250
with whom they share a true connection,
 unswayed by appearances.

04:33.250 --> 04:36.000
Unswayed by appearances?

04:36.000 --> 04:38.300
How's that work if no one's
hiding their legs?

04:38.300 --> 04:40.840
Y-You're the only person who'd care about that!

04:42.890 --> 04:45.120
Still, it sure is pretty.

04:45.120 --> 04:47.680
I've never seen fireworks before, man!

04:47.680 --> 04:49.790
N-Never?

04:49.790 --> 04:52.640
But we watched them
together three years ago.

04:52.640 --> 04:55.320
Y-Yeah, I forgot about that!

04:55.320 --> 04:57.430
It was just the two of us here then, too...

04:57.430 --> 05:00.440
Three years ago, we watched them 
from the castle balcony.

05:00.440 --> 05:02.320
With Isaac and the others.

05:03.210 --> 05:05.180
I knew that something was amiss.

05:05.180 --> 05:07.980
Your speech and mannerisms are 
quite unlike three years ago.

05:07.980 --> 05:12.430
I convinced myself it was because you 
were trying to grow closer to me.

05:12.430 --> 05:15.210
But you also seem to have
forgotten our time together

05:15.210 --> 05:16.820
and the promise we made...

05:17.440 --> 05:18.380
Mr. Hero.

05:18.890 --> 05:21.090
Who are you really?

05:24.330 --> 05:26.130
You've been unmasked.

05:26.130 --> 05:29.600
<i>It's the jerk with the eyepatch...
Oh, and the babe with luscious thighs!</i>

05:30.050 --> 05:33.350
Um, I love an assertive woman and all, but...

05:33.350 --> 05:34.820
Quiet, scum.

05:34.820 --> 05:36.740
You really are a skeleton, aren't you?

05:36.740 --> 05:38.770
I see. There's necromancy at work here.

05:39.200 --> 05:41.080
He's an imposter.

05:41.080 --> 05:42.900
The legendary hero is dead.

05:43.400 --> 05:45.530
I-It can't be...

05:55.120 --> 05:57.080
The hero fell in a hole and died?

05:57.080 --> 05:59.330
You expect us to believe that?!

05:59.330 --> 06:01.720
No, I can see it.

06:01.720 --> 06:04.270
He loved meat. 
Always let his guard down over it.

06:04.270 --> 06:05.180
Right?!

06:05.180 --> 06:07.710
And now I'm cleaning up
the clumsy hero's mess!

06:07.710 --> 06:09.610
If anything, you guys owe me!

06:09.610 --> 06:10.550
Shut your mouth!

06:10.550 --> 06:13.950
You employed necromancy to 
impersonate the legendary hero!

06:13.950 --> 06:15.740
That alone deserves a death sentence!

06:15.740 --> 06:16.520
A death sentence?!

06:16.520 --> 06:19.870
You need me to seal the Gates of Hell!

06:19.870 --> 06:21.730
Hey! C'mon, lady! Help me out here!

06:21.730 --> 06:22.880
Kill him.

06:22.880 --> 06:23.940
Et tu?!

06:23.940 --> 06:25.740
What about the seal, then?

06:25.740 --> 06:28.560
Easily resolved if I slay all the devils.

06:28.890 --> 06:30.190
You can rest in peace.

06:30.190 --> 06:31.620
H-Hang on!

06:31.620 --> 06:34.760
I'm really sorry about hurting the princess.

06:34.760 --> 06:36.500
Give me a chance to apologize to her!

06:36.500 --> 06:37.890
I see.

06:37.890 --> 06:41.940
As she was your greatest victim,
you wish for her to deliver your death sentence.

06:41.940 --> 06:43.880
All roads lead to a death sentence, huh?

06:45.060 --> 06:46.340
Your Highness?

06:48.300 --> 06:50.310
<i>It can't be! It just can't be!</i>

06:50.310 --> 06:51.670
<i>The hero is dead?</i>

06:51.670 --> 06:53.300
<i>The hero is dead?!</i>

06:53.300 --> 06:55.960
<i>So if I was raised to marry him,</i>

06:55.960 --> 06:57.770
<i>what's my purpose in life now?!</i>

06:58.270 --> 06:59.240
Your Highness?

07:02.940 --> 07:04.610
What's the matter, dear?

07:04.610 --> 07:06.390
You look so terribly distraught.

07:06.390 --> 07:07.690
Doctor...

07:07.690 --> 07:09.450
Don't you worry.

07:09.450 --> 07:12.660
There's no more need for sadness.
I'll save you.

07:13.220 --> 07:14.160
<i>That's right.</i>

07:14.540 --> 07:18.230
<i>The doctor was always kind 
to me when things were hard.</i>

07:18.230 --> 07:20.370
<i>Dr. Leland can...</i>

07:20.970 --> 07:21.830
Your Highness!

07:21.830 --> 07:22.950
Calm down.

07:22.950 --> 07:25.240
The Knights are in charge of city security.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.340
Dame Siruela!

07:26.800 --> 07:28.780
Devils have appeared in the city!

07:28.780 --> 07:29.650
What?!

07:29.650 --> 07:31.180
Why did you let them in?

07:31.180 --> 07:33.510
They just appeared in the middle of town!

07:33.510 --> 07:34.720
Hey! You!

07:34.720 --> 07:35.600
Are you running away?

07:35.600 --> 07:37.430
What? Hell no!

07:37.430 --> 07:39.310
I'm gonna get the princess back!

07:40.250 --> 07:41.370
What is this place?

07:41.370 --> 07:43.020
A slum.

07:43.020 --> 07:46.940
You want to save those struggling 
with poverty, don't you?

07:46.940 --> 07:48.570
Why, of course I do.

07:48.570 --> 07:50.650
But I don't know how I...

07:51.900 --> 07:53.680
No need to worry.

07:53.680 --> 07:57.280
I'll save you. I'll save all of you.

07:57.840 --> 08:01.610
And I'll liberate you from 
the pressures of your royal title.

08:02.620 --> 08:03.840
Who are they?

08:03.840 --> 08:05.960
Former patients of mine.

08:07.420 --> 08:08.670
Doctor?!

08:08.670 --> 08:13.190
For ages, I've wanted to strip you of your blood, 
your flesh, your skin,

08:13.190 --> 08:16.390
and free you from all that binds you!

08:16.390 --> 08:17.980
No! Let me go!

08:17.980 --> 08:19.170
Marguerite!

08:19.850 --> 08:21.660
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

08:21.660 --> 08:23.690
You're that orphanage director.

08:23.690 --> 08:25.660
What's the hero doing here?

08:25.660 --> 08:27.430
No matter. I won't let you interfere.

08:27.770 --> 08:29.610
Two on one?! No fair!

08:32.400 --> 08:33.860
Skeletons?

08:33.860 --> 08:35.360
Someone used necromancy to—

08:36.870 --> 08:38.700
Eh? You're awfully weak.

08:38.700 --> 08:42.000
I see. An impostor playing the hero, are we?

08:42.780 --> 08:44.870
Get your damn hands off Marguerite!

08:44.870 --> 08:47.300
Why are you trying to save me?

08:47.300 --> 08:49.800
You were trying to deceive me...

08:49.800 --> 08:53.920
I'm always getting carried away 
and doing stupid stuff.

08:53.920 --> 08:56.390
I hurt you real bad as a result.

08:56.710 --> 08:59.690
I know I'm the worst
piece of trash in the land.

08:59.690 --> 09:00.850
But...

09:00.850 --> 09:03.810
Only someone <i>really</i> rotten would 
abandon a good person like you,

09:03.810 --> 09:05.600
and I'm not quite that far gone.

09:09.310 --> 09:10.980
Mr. Hero!

09:18.170 --> 09:20.660
<i>They're models from the museum.</i>

09:20.660 --> 09:22.080
<i>Necromancy, huh?</i>

09:22.080 --> 09:24.770
<i>Is it the work of one of the
false hero's companions?</i>

09:24.770 --> 09:26.770
I'm going to find the princess!

09:26.770 --> 09:28.900
Return to your posts and stay vigilant!

09:30.560 --> 09:32.470
I can't wait any longer.

09:32.470 --> 09:34.430
I'm gonna eat one of them.

09:35.110 --> 09:36.070
<i>This is my chance!</i>

09:36.070 --> 09:37.300
Okay.

09:37.300 --> 09:39.630
I guess we'd better get going, too.

09:43.570 --> 09:45.230
He'll strip you down to bones?

09:45.230 --> 09:49.940
Too bad. I kinda like how you look.

09:50.310 --> 09:54.650
If you don't like skeletons, 
why work with Leland?

09:54.650 --> 09:56.210
Money, I guess.

09:56.210 --> 09:59.620
And I love seeing
 the despair on people's faces

09:59.620 --> 10:01.860
when they learn the truth.

10:02.420 --> 10:04.830
Glad to hear you're such garbage.

10:04.830 --> 10:06.460
It'll be my pleasure to pulverize you.

10:06.460 --> 10:07.130
What?

10:07.130 --> 10:08.720
Ein Grendel!

10:11.420 --> 10:12.880
Ow!

10:13.580 --> 10:14.640
But I'm still alive!

10:14.640 --> 10:15.970
Zombiehood rocks!

10:16.840 --> 10:18.140
Hey, cut it out!

10:18.140 --> 10:19.800
Where is that impostor hero?!

10:23.380 --> 10:24.770
H-Hey there.

10:27.520 --> 10:29.440
Dr. Leland took the princess?!

10:29.910 --> 10:31.110
Good, it reattached!

10:31.110 --> 10:33.110
He dragged her off that way—

10:33.110 --> 10:34.510
Don't you lie to me!

10:34.510 --> 10:36.390
One of your companions did this!

10:36.390 --> 10:38.360
Are you trying to fool us?!

10:38.360 --> 10:40.380
You think I tore off my head as a trick?!

10:40.380 --> 10:41.820
That hurt like hell, dude!

10:42.920 --> 10:43.870
Listen.

10:43.870 --> 10:47.640
If it turns out I'm the real hero, 
can I avoid the death penalty?

10:47.640 --> 10:49.860
But you're not. You're an impostor.

10:49.860 --> 10:53.210
Saving a princess is a legendary hero job.

10:53.210 --> 10:56.290
I'm gonna <i>become</i> a real hero!

10:56.290 --> 10:58.280
I'm gonna save the princess!

11:01.470 --> 11:04.180
Oh nooo. Save me.

11:04.180 --> 11:06.520
I d-don't wanna die...

11:06.520 --> 11:08.480
Siruela of the Thunder Sword?!

11:08.480 --> 11:11.560
Just what I'd expect from Leland.
That's an impressive catch.

11:11.940 --> 11:13.810
Infiltration complete.

11:13.810 --> 11:18.080
You talked a good game, but there was 
nothing heroic about that plan.

11:18.080 --> 11:20.510
What's it matter? We got in safe and sound!

11:20.510 --> 11:22.780
By the way, you two are lousy actors!

11:22.780 --> 11:25.610
Anyway, given what the guardsman said,

11:25.610 --> 11:27.540
I suppose Leland really is behind this.

11:27.540 --> 11:29.440
It's all my fault.

11:29.750 --> 11:35.420
I'm the reason Her Highness 
developed MES and turned to Leland.

11:35.420 --> 11:36.960
Whazzat mean?

11:36.960 --> 11:41.720
I put her through intense training to become
a bride worthy of the legendary hero.

11:42.320 --> 11:44.100
The former crybaby princess

11:44.100 --> 11:47.760
grew into a strong woman 
who never shed a tear.

11:47.760 --> 11:50.180
But the stress of that training...

11:50.180 --> 11:52.640
led her to develop MES.

11:52.970 --> 11:55.770
Because I was so hard on her, 
she wouldn't ask for my help.

11:55.770 --> 11:57.730
Instead, she became dependent on Leland.

11:57.730 --> 12:01.180
I never even investigated his character.

12:01.180 --> 12:04.500
I just looked the other way, 
ashamed of losing her trust.

12:05.480 --> 12:07.560
I'm a failure as a tutor.

12:07.560 --> 12:10.950
In other words, this whole damn thing
is 100 percent your fault!

12:10.950 --> 12:12.210
One hundred percent?!

12:13.630 --> 12:16.530
And the reason you were
on my case from the start

12:16.530 --> 12:19.150
is because you wanted to blame the hero

12:19.150 --> 12:21.330
for Marguerite's illness and her hating you!

12:21.330 --> 12:24.730
I mean, I do accept some fault...
but <i>100 percent</i>?

12:24.730 --> 12:27.380
Boy, look at this irresponsible bozo.

12:27.380 --> 12:29.390
Feel bad, you blame-shifting jerkwad.

12:29.390 --> 12:30.930
You've been shifting blame, too!

12:30.930 --> 12:31.990
Nuh-uh!

12:31.990 --> 12:34.520
This guy's the king of blame-shifting.

12:34.520 --> 12:36.840
If I don't get an apology soon, I'll—

12:40.570 --> 12:42.480
Wh-What the... Yuna?

12:42.480 --> 12:43.780
Touka?

12:45.490 --> 12:47.710
I thought you'd come save me,

12:47.710 --> 12:50.020
and here you got the princess in trouble?

12:50.020 --> 12:51.300
You really are the worst.

12:51.300 --> 12:52.900
I'm the one who deserves your scorn!

12:52.900 --> 12:55.750
I'm the source of all this trouble!

12:55.750 --> 12:57.880
I admit it! It was all me!

12:57.880 --> 12:59.750
This guy's creeping me out.

13:00.540 --> 13:04.220
Tell us where the princess is, 
and we'll spare your life.

13:04.220 --> 13:05.220
Well?

13:06.490 --> 13:09.260
I guess money won't help me if I'm dead, will it?

13:09.950 --> 13:11.100
Anri!

13:11.100 --> 13:13.060
Sir Touka! Dame Yuna!

13:13.060 --> 13:16.020
I knew you'd come to save me!

13:16.020 --> 13:17.240
<i>Gross.</i>

13:18.090 --> 13:21.980
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot.
Rock, paper, scissors...

13:19.940 --> 13:21.980
Why are you playing rock-paper-scissors?!

13:24.420 --> 13:27.530
Now, let us begin the ritual of salvation.

13:28.070 --> 13:33.070
Tonight, all those assembled here 
will be stripped down to their bones.

13:33.070 --> 13:34.250
Their bones?

13:34.250 --> 13:37.210
Yes! That will be your salvation.

13:38.210 --> 13:41.710
Behold the X-ray magic crystal
handed down through my family.

13:42.450 --> 13:47.550
Its power has given us 
standing and prestige as doctors.

13:47.550 --> 13:50.260
But it's done more than just that.

13:50.260 --> 13:55.480
This magic crystal has shown me 
the truth of things.

13:55.480 --> 13:58.440
Beneath the skin, we're all the same,

13:58.440 --> 14:01.360
so why is the world full of such tragedy?

14:01.360 --> 14:03.320
I struggled with that question...

14:03.690 --> 14:07.140
Until Sion the legendary hero appeared.

14:07.140 --> 14:12.780
Watching him offer salvation to one and all
 left a deep impression on me.

14:12.780 --> 14:17.250
To create a conflict-free world
where we are all truly equal,

14:18.090 --> 14:21.630
we must pare down everything extraneous.

14:22.170 --> 14:23.970
That's why you're doing this?!

14:23.970 --> 14:28.760
But the love you felt for the 
orphans seemed so genuine!

14:28.760 --> 14:32.010
Yes. I mean to save those 
children as well someday.

14:32.010 --> 14:35.470
Once they've matured into 
their most beautiful forms.

14:35.470 --> 14:37.670
You're special, though.

14:37.670 --> 14:42.100
I never thought you'd grow 
into such an appealing form yourself.

14:43.990 --> 14:47.310
I've fallen in love with you, you see.

14:47.310 --> 14:50.880
Tonight's ritual will double 
as our marriage ceremony.

14:50.880 --> 14:51.870
Marriage?!

14:52.450 --> 14:53.700
There's a lot of them.

14:53.700 --> 14:55.660
Devils, too.

14:55.660 --> 14:59.380
The princess comes first. 
Sacrifices are acceptable.

14:59.380 --> 15:00.120
Not so fast.

15:00.120 --> 15:01.620
I guess we'll have to see...

15:01.620 --> 15:04.590
Whether he's an impostor 
or the real deal.

15:04.980 --> 15:08.130
If you can break the caster's 
concentration for just a second,

15:08.130 --> 15:10.550
I can steal control of the skeletons.

15:10.550 --> 15:13.140
Great! Hang on tight, then!

15:13.140 --> 15:14.280
I refuse!

15:14.280 --> 15:17.350
It's true that I trusted you 
and respected you,

15:17.350 --> 15:19.920
but I simply don't feel that way about you!

15:19.920 --> 15:22.310
You do not love me?

15:22.310 --> 15:24.170
You're mistaken.

15:24.170 --> 15:28.570
I'll liberate you and make you 
realize your true feelings.

15:33.490 --> 15:35.850
<i>Why am I thinking about that awful man?!</i>

15:36.830 --> 15:37.830
Hold it!

15:37.830 --> 15:39.250
I'll be taking her back now!

15:39.250 --> 15:41.620
She's <i>my</i> bride, you see!

15:44.230 --> 15:44.690
Wha?

15:47.090 --> 15:49.300
Now <i>that</i> felt good.

15:49.300 --> 15:51.310
Mr. Hero?

15:51.310 --> 15:53.190
I said I wouldn't abandon you.

15:53.650 --> 15:55.660
Also, my name's Touka.

15:55.660 --> 15:57.170
Touka Scott.

15:59.720 --> 16:02.610
Thank you so much, Touka!

16:03.190 --> 16:06.230
<i>I was certain I'd taken his head...</i>

16:06.720 --> 16:10.180
Detain them, my skeletons!

16:10.900 --> 16:13.070
They belong to me now.

16:13.530 --> 16:15.030
A necromancer?!

16:15.030 --> 16:18.640
Welp, looks like your evil deeds are done.

16:18.640 --> 16:20.430
Ready to pay the piper?

16:20.430 --> 16:22.080
Don't touch that mask!

16:22.080 --> 16:24.960
The X-ray magic crystal 
is our family heirloom!

16:24.960 --> 16:26.420
Did you say X-ray?

16:26.990 --> 16:31.880
So peeking at bones gave you a fetish
that you turned criminal for, huh?

16:31.880 --> 16:33.840
You bottom-feeding perv!

16:33.840 --> 16:35.860
That one's Togras.

16:36.930 --> 16:38.300
Ein Togras!

16:39.010 --> 16:41.510
Hey! Even with my crappy mana—

16:41.510 --> 16:43.640
I knew you'd try that,
you bottom-feeding perv!

16:45.860 --> 16:47.700
There are more than I expected.

16:50.550 --> 16:51.610
Leland's running!

16:51.610 --> 16:52.950
Leave these guys to us.

16:52.950 --> 16:54.650
You pursue Leland!

16:55.500 --> 16:56.610
I can't fail here.

16:56.610 --> 16:59.180
I need to save more people!

17:00.580 --> 17:02.540
You're not getting away now.

17:02.540 --> 17:04.830
Oh, but I am.

17:06.330 --> 17:09.040
No!

17:07.710 --> 17:09.050
Yuna!

17:09.050 --> 17:09.790
A miracle!

17:09.790 --> 17:11.130
Help me, damn it!

17:13.750 --> 17:17.430
This is an underground graveyard 
for those who died three years ago.

17:17.430 --> 17:19.890
It looks like the tables have turned, hmm?

17:19.890 --> 17:21.670
Is that what you think?

17:21.670 --> 17:23.720
You think you can beat our Anri?

17:23.720 --> 17:25.850
That's why I'm using these.

17:26.900 --> 17:27.770
No!

17:27.770 --> 17:30.170
If you take that many soma drops at once...

17:30.170 --> 17:31.110
Indeed.

17:31.110 --> 17:34.820
Neither my mind nor body will be able
 to withstand the surge of mana.

17:34.820 --> 17:37.820
But this is my eleventh hour.

17:37.820 --> 17:41.080
I will ride this out and achieve my dream.

17:41.080 --> 17:42.870
Ein Sayil!

17:43.190 --> 17:44.580
Ein Rosabis!

17:44.580 --> 17:46.750
Spells for creating weapons 
and enhancing toughness!

17:49.670 --> 17:50.610
Anri!

17:50.610 --> 17:52.380
I'll be taking her back now.

17:52.380 --> 17:54.840
I can no longer return to the capital.

17:54.840 --> 17:57.300
But at the very least, I'll have her!

18:01.680 --> 18:03.000
Isaac!

18:03.400 --> 18:05.140
This was my choice...

18:05.950 --> 18:10.950
I've stifled you for so long 
and made you suffer.

18:10.950 --> 18:13.360
But now you'll be free.

18:13.360 --> 18:17.660
Your Highness, you must live 
for yourself from now on!

18:17.660 --> 18:19.570
Sorry it's your big scene and all,

18:19.570 --> 18:20.950
but I gotta interrupt!

18:20.740 --> 18:22.240
<b>Form Change: Wall</b>

18:23.910 --> 18:25.490
Escape accomplished!

18:25.490 --> 18:27.870
Let's get back to the babe
with luscious thighs!

18:32.850 --> 18:34.830
A spell to create a wall?

18:35.980 --> 18:37.970
But you didn't cover your tracks...

18:38.660 --> 18:40.910
We're not far from the capital.

18:40.910 --> 18:43.410
This is where we camped out.

18:43.410 --> 18:44.810
Let's make a break for the city.

18:44.810 --> 18:46.140
Wait a moment!

18:46.140 --> 18:49.270
We would be dragging 
the citizens into our fight.

18:49.270 --> 18:52.730
Yeah, okay. Guess we gotta settle things here.

18:55.230 --> 18:57.690
<i>You can't escape me, you know.</i>

18:58.870 --> 19:00.650
It's working like a charm.

19:00.650 --> 19:03.620
These rainbow grapes really came in handy.

19:03.620 --> 19:07.000
It only figures he'd try to track us.

19:07.000 --> 19:10.840
So if he follows the trail of grape juice
that you and I left, thinking it's a bloodstain...

19:07.000 --> 19:11.230
<b>Touka</b>

19:07.000 --> 19:11.230
<b>Yuna</b>

19:10.750 --> 19:13.960
<b>Leland</b>

19:10.840 --> 19:13.960
he'll just keep going in circles.

19:14.230 --> 19:17.550
To buy us to safety in such a manner...

19:17.550 --> 19:20.680
Touka, who are you truly?

19:21.090 --> 19:23.220
I've been wondering that myself.

19:23.220 --> 19:25.610
You were like this against Sir Kyle as well.

19:25.610 --> 19:27.600
Your strategic mind surpasses even the hero's.

19:27.600 --> 19:29.730
Is there some secret behind it?

19:31.440 --> 19:32.830
I'm actually—

19:32.830 --> 19:34.020
A degenerate farmer.

19:34.020 --> 19:34.740
Yuna!

19:34.740 --> 19:37.760
That was my big chance to earn their respect!

19:37.760 --> 19:40.780
I've known him for ages. 
He's just a crafty little sneak.

19:40.780 --> 19:43.410
There's more you don't know about me, though!

19:43.410 --> 19:45.360
Oh? Like what?

19:45.990 --> 19:48.700
Before the Gates of Hell opened,

19:49.150 --> 19:53.170
the kingdoms of Farom and Arat 
to the north were at war.

19:53.170 --> 19:55.890
My asshole dad wanted
to loot a burned-out city,

19:55.890 --> 19:58.130
so he dragged me and my mom along.

19:58.130 --> 20:00.390
The fighting was way worse than he thought.

20:00.390 --> 20:03.090
My mom was killed. My dad went missing.

20:03.090 --> 20:07.630
I got left on my own, and I spent 
over a year running and hiding

20:07.630 --> 20:09.560
before I finally made it home.

20:09.560 --> 20:12.700
I think that experience is paying off now.

20:13.850 --> 20:15.450
What a tragic past!

20:15.450 --> 20:17.890
Sir Touka! You're no longer alone!

20:17.890 --> 20:20.110
I'll remain by your side forever!

20:20.110 --> 20:21.820
Can we get back to the topic at hand?

20:22.340 --> 20:23.830
So, what now?

20:23.830 --> 20:26.390
Can we just hide until he runs out of mana?

20:26.390 --> 20:28.990
He boosted it with soma drops.

20:28.990 --> 20:31.670
He'll definitely find us before it runs out.

20:31.670 --> 20:34.290
What if we were to steal 
the soma drops from him?

20:34.290 --> 20:37.330
We could increase Sir Touka's
mana as well that way.

20:37.330 --> 20:40.600
We can't guarantee
he hasn't used them all already.

20:41.350 --> 20:42.510
True enough.

20:43.010 --> 20:45.500
There's another way to increase your mana.

20:46.790 --> 20:48.430
The princess's bodily fluids.

20:48.430 --> 20:50.390
Bodily fluids...?

20:50.390 --> 20:57.110
The brain of an MES patient sends false signals
that cause the body to expel mana via fluids.

20:57.110 --> 21:02.180
Her Highness's bodily fluids
contain concentrated mana,

21:02.180 --> 21:05.150
though not as potent as soma drops.

21:05.600 --> 21:07.960
Y-You wanna be more specific here?

21:08.910 --> 21:11.570
Sweat. Tears. Snot.

21:11.570 --> 21:12.930
And urine!

21:13.290 --> 21:15.090
Tears seem like the least offensive option.

21:15.090 --> 21:16.050
C'mon, Marguerite.

21:16.050 --> 21:18.410
Cry! Wail! And let me drink your tears!

21:18.410 --> 21:21.750
Impossible! I have not shed 
a single tear for ten years!

21:21.750 --> 21:24.000
The result of the training
I put her through...

21:24.000 --> 21:25.960
It isn't your fault, Isaac!

21:25.960 --> 21:27.720
No, I am responsible.

21:27.720 --> 21:28.730
I guess that's it.

21:28.730 --> 21:30.180
I'll have to make do with sweat.

21:30.900 --> 21:33.250
Stay away from me! What are you doing?!

21:33.250 --> 21:34.640
My precious sweat!

21:35.120 --> 21:36.730
C'mon, stop recoiling in horror!

21:37.080 --> 21:40.400
Would you like to try my snot?

21:40.400 --> 21:41.570
Why the hell would I?!

21:41.570 --> 21:43.530
Damn it. Urine, then?

21:43.530 --> 21:45.040
Absolutely not!

21:45.040 --> 21:46.060
You megaperv!

21:46.060 --> 21:47.450
I don't wanna do it either!

21:47.450 --> 21:49.820
But if it's the only way, 
what choice do we have?!

21:49.820 --> 21:52.570
In terms of volume, 
it does seem the best way.

21:52.570 --> 21:54.060
Not you too, Isaac!

21:55.330 --> 21:56.750
Very well.

21:56.750 --> 21:59.960
Touka, please lie down and close your eyes.

21:59.960 --> 22:02.050
I'm kind of a skeleton, 
so closing eyes is no-go—

22:03.440 --> 22:05.680
A-Are you really gonna do it?

22:06.460 --> 22:08.360
For the peace of my kingdom.

22:10.010 --> 22:21.060
<b>Next Time</b>

22:11.010 --> 22:21.060
<b>The Legendary Hero Is Revived</b>
